<code>assert index >= 0 && index <= \old(this.size()) => \forall int i; index <= i && i < \old(this.size()); (this.get(i).equals(\old(this.get(i+1))) || (\old(this.get(i+1)) == null && this.get(i) == null));</code>

This assert statement captures the condition that for every valid index from the specified index to the old size of the list, the element at the next position is either null if the old element at this position was null, or it equals the old element at this position.
